9,"Jola-Felupe language. Evangelism tools, church planting resources...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/eja,"Jola-Felupe language and dialect information.Short audio Bible stories and evangelistic messages that explain salvation and give basic Christian teaching. Each program is a customised and culturally relevant selection of scripts, and may include songs and music. Same both sides.",Jola-Felupe,Niger-Congo
